OL,3,GNEWSAMystery baby was garroted and
OL,4,Ahidden under floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby found beneath floorboards and
OL,7,Fwrapped in a 1910 newspaper was
OL,8,Fprobably garroted shortly after birth,
OL,9,Fa coroner has said.
OL,11,FThe skeleton of the full-term boy was
OL,12,Fdiscovered during the renovation of a
OL,13,Fbuilding on Bishop Auckland's Fore
OL,14,FBondgate in July 2024.
OL,16,FA piece of twine wrapped around his
OL,17,Fneck raised suspicions for detectives,
OL,18,FCounty Durham and Darlington Coroner
OL,19,FCrispin Oliver heard.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
