OL,3,GNEWSAMystery baby was garroted and
OL,4,Ahidden under floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter concluding it was most likely a
OL,7,Fhomicide, Oliver said it was a "very
OL,8,Fsad and singular case". The boy, named
OL,9,FBaby Auckland by authorities, has been
OL,10,Fburied in Bishop Auckland Town
OL,11,FCemetery.
